T1  - A New SiF–Dipropargyl Glycerol Scaffold as a Versatile Prosthetic Group to Design Dimeric Radioligands: Synthesis of the [18F]BMPPSiF Tracer to Image Serotonin Receptors
AU  - Hazari, Puja Panwar
AU  - Schulz, Jurgen
AU  - Vimont, Delphine
